3. Refatorar `templates/includes/sidebar.html`.
4. Refatorar `templates/app/resource_list.html`.
5. Refatorar `templates/app/resource_form.html`.
6. Refatorar `templates/app/resource_detail.html`.
7. Refatorar `templates/app/resource_confirm_delete.html`.
8. Ajustar CSS em `static/css/app.css`.
9. Ajustar JS de formularios quando necessario.
